    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can retreat from enemies with additional speed and agility.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a>; <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hovering\" title=\"Hovering\">Hovering</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flying\" title=\"Flying\">Flying</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wheeled\" title=\"Wheeled\">Wheeled</a>, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tracked\" title=\"Tracked\">Tracked</a> Locomotion; <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Withdraw\" title=\"Withdraw\">Withdraw</a> Action, you can move up to 2 squares to escape <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Threatened\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Threatened\">Threatened</a> squares without provoking an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a>, and you can move your Speed. You can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> to an enemy ending its movement adjacent to you to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Withdraw\" title=\"Withdraw\">Withdraw</a>.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> When using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Withdraw\" title=\"Withdraw\">Withdraw</a> Action, you can normally move only 1 square to escape a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Threatened\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Threatened\">Threatened</a> square without provoking an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a> and can move only up to half your Speed.</p><p><b>Special:</b> You must be equipped with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hovering\" title=\"Hovering\">Hovering</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flying\" title=\"Flying\">Flying</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wheeled\" title=\"Wheeled\">Wheeled</a>, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tracked\" title=\"Tracked\">Tracked</a> Locomotion to use this Feat.</p>",
